=== Acceptance evidence ===
Files (allowed-files scope = the AINLDriveSearch surface dir + log; the test + androidTest files are added per
the prompt's "adapter unit test + per-state snapshot/UI test + a11y label test" acceptance criteria, matching the
sibling AICostForecastNarration / AIGeofenceAwareAutomationSuggestions surfaces):
  main/.../AINLDriveSearch/AINLDriveSearchModel.kt       (pure model + SSE parse + classifier + a11y builders)
  main/.../AINLDriveSearch/AINLDriveSearchSource.kt      (aiEnabled() + search(prompt) seam + factory)
  main/.../AINLDriveSearch/AINLDriveSearchViewModel.kt   (P1/S8 state holder; no HTTP in the view)
  main/.../AINLDriveSearch/AINLDriveSearch.kt            (Compose + Material 3 view + 6 @Preview)
  test/.../AINLDriveSearch/AINLDriveSearchModelTest.kt       (35 tests, all green)
  test/.../AINLDriveSearch/AINLDriveSearchViewModelTest.kt   (14 tests, all green)
  androidTest/.../ainldrivesearch/AINLDriveSearchUiTest.kt   (per-state + a11y UI; instrumented)

- Parity vs web/src/components/ai/AINLDriveSearch.tsx: withAiFeature('nl-drive-search-replay') gate ->
  DriveSearchSurface.Hidden; useAiStream({url:'/ai/drives/search', body:{prompt}, onEvent:()=>{}}) -> the search
  stream whose only output is accumulated delta narration text; canStart = prompt.trim().length>0; Textarea
  inputSlot + "Search with Helix" CTA (visible "Ask Helix", aria/contentDescription "Ask Helix · Search with
  Helix") + Helix badge + propose-only description. i18n keys drives.aiSearch.{title,description,searchButton,
  badge,placeholder} + helix.* resolve through the P1/S10 facade; each English fallback equals the string i18next
  renders from web/src/i18n/en.json (incl. the long placeholder copy the web actually shows).
- States (all render, none hidden, all unit-tested in classifyDriveSearch + exercised in AINLDriveSearchUiTest):
  loading (Working: thinking + skeleton), content (Live partial / Ready completed), empty (no-match), error
  (Failed + retry), stale (Ready stale chip past the freshness window), offline (Cached network-failure
  last-known + offline chip + retry). The retry affordance disables in lockstep with the prompt gate.
- Hooks bind via the shared P1/S8 holder (AINLDriveSearchViewModel over AINLDriveSearchSource); the view does NO HTTP.
- a11y: header is a heading + merged contentDescription; Search + Retry expose accessible labels/click actions;
  output is a polite live region; reduce-motion suppresses the skeleton shimmer; TalkBack labels unit-tested via
  headerAccessibilityLabel + searchOutputAccessibilityLabel.
- Telemetry: onViewOpened() emits one PII-safe view.opened {slug=AINLDriveSearch} (P1/S11).
- A pre-commit parity code review ran; both Low findings were fixed (placeholder fallback now matches the
  en.json string the web renders; Retry button gated on canStart). Re-gated green below.

